0..56 Comment "//! `state-wp` observes state as predicate transformers."
57..60 Comment "//!"
61..139 Comment "//! A transformer maps a postcondition and initial state to a precondition. It"
140..215 Comment "//! has type `((A, S) => Type, S) => Type`. It uncurries the transformer of"
216..281 Comment "//! § 3.4 of the cited work, and it reads propositions as types."
282..285 Comment "//!"
286..365 Comment "//! The handler maps `get` and `put` into state predicates. The scope satisfies"
366..442 Comment "//! state laws. The observation is a monad morphism from state programs. The"
443..518 Comment "//! normaliser runs no scope yet. So it computes a precondition through the"
519..553 Comment "//! fold in `tree-state-wp.gandr`."
554..557 Comment "//!"
558..574 Comment "//! - see: #2754"
575..623 Comment "//! - cites: [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]"
624..739 Comment "//! [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3341708 \"Maillard et al., Dijkstra Monads for All\""
741..771 Comment "// The import gives StateLaws."
